Z||000004||terryk||03-06-2000||12:36 PM||||You should be able to get another prom from the dealer. Any 86-88 V6 auto ECM/prom should work. You can always buy an aftermarket prom too.||||reg||1
Z||000005||theogre||03-07-2000||06:59 PM||||It's posible but rare for a prom to go bad. Try pulling it off and reseating it. A dirty contact could make it act up.<P>I don't think the connector will let you seat the prom wrong without breaking the thing. Of course some ingrate could have put the prom into the shell wrong...... If the prom was somehow in backwards it's ruined.<P>You can get an OEM prom nearly anyplace. You have to make sure what ECM it comes from if you pull on someplace. There are a 2-3 diferant ones and the proms don't change between them all.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 03-07-2000).]||||reg||1
